{"name":"click","description":"Click exactly one target: an element center or x/y coordinates from the model-visible screenshot. For visual x/y clicks, report coordinates in the dimensions actually rendered by the model provider and provide viewport_width/viewport_height; the helper restores them to original screenshot pixels. The helper routes pointer-equivalent actions through native physical input so modal-opening providers cannot block the serial helper transport. element_index and visual coordinates are mutually exclusive. Use only short indexes from the latest bounded get_app_state preview or find_elements result; pathIndex is diagnostic-only. Read state afterward when the visible effect determines the next action or crosses a meaningful UI boundary.","input":{"additionalProperties":false,"anyOf":[{"required":["window_id"]},{"required":["app"]},{"required":["name"]},{"required":["window_title"]},{"required":["process_id"]},{"required":["path"]},{"required":["executable_path"]},{"required":["app_user_model_id"]}],"oneOf":[{"not":{"anyOf":[{"required":["x"]},{"required":["y"]},{"required":["viewport_width"]},{"required":["viewport_height"]},{"required":["screenshot_id"]}]},"required":["element_index"]},{"not":{"required":["element_index"]},"required":["x","y","viewport_width","viewport_height"]},{"not":{"anyOf":[{"required":["element_index"]},{"required":["viewport_width"]},{"required":["viewport_height"]}]},"required":["x","y"]}],"properties":{"app":{"description":"App display name, executable name/path, or process id. Use window_title for title-based targeting.","type":"string"},"app_user_model_id":{"description":"Canonical Windows AppUserModelID returned by list_apps.","type":"string"},"brief":{"description":"One short user-facing sentence describing what Manus is doing in this app now. Write it in the user's language.","maxLength":160,"type":"string"},"click_count":{"default":1,"maximum":3,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"element_index":{"description":"Element